# enroll-web — remote-enrollment relay (ADR-0016)
#
# Never commit real values. These are the ONLY secrets this deployment holds, and
# neither can decrypt an enrollment bundle (E-9): the sealing private key lives on
# the door Pi's encrypted volume and is never published here.

# Shared bearer token authenticating the door Pi to this relay. Must match
# VISIOND_RELAY_DEVICE_TOKEN on the Pi. Generate with:
#   openssl rand -base64 36 | tr -d '\n' | tr '+/' '-_'
RELAY_DEVICE_TOKEN=

# Upstash Redis (ADR-0016 §5). The Vercel marketplace integration injects the
# KV_REST_API_* pair automatically; set the UPSTASH_* pair for a manual/local setup.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
# KV_REST_API_URL=
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
